<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy Notice | Primeserve GST Document Centre</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/portal.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/customer.css"></head><body><header class="brand-header"><div class="brand-wrap header-inner"><a href="/"><img class="brand-logo-image" src="/primeserve-logo.png" alt="Primeserve"></a></div></header><main class="workspace customer-workspace"><section class="portal-card"><h1>Privacy Notice</h1><p>Primeserve Global Solution Private Limited — notice version <?= esc(\App\Libraries\PrivacyConsent::VERSION) ?>.</p><h2>Information and purposes</h2><p>We process your name, company, email and mobile number to create and secure your account, verify email, communicate service updates and provide support. For requested GST services, we process GSTIN, GST username, authentication credentials and OTP, API requests and the returned returns, challans or certificate to authenticate with GST services and retrieve and deliver your documents. Submit another person's information only with appropriate authority.</p><p>Billing state/GSTIN, wallet transactions, payments, refunds and usage charges are processed for billing, reconciliation and account administration. API activity records include originating IP and status for security and troubleshooting. Service providers involved include Primeserve API infrastructure, GST systems and Zoho for transactional email. Consent does not include marketing.</p><h2>Storage and retention</h2><p>GST return connections are encrypted and can remain valid for up to 30 days. Return job/download records expire 10 minutes after download confirmation; undownloaded work has a separate 24-hour limit. Challan and certificate responses are processed for delivery without retained response storage. GST passwords used for those requests are not saved. Customer postpaid API keys are encrypted only for the login session and cleared on logout or expiry. Activity logs are retained for 30 days by default. Account, consent and financial records are retained separately for account administration, evidence and applicable legal obligations. Copies saved on your device or held by upstream providers are outside the portal's deletion controls.</p><h2>Your choice and withdrawal</h2><p>Consent is recorded once for the stated purposes. You do not need to tick it again at each login or download. A new purpose or expanded processing requires a fresh consent request. In My Account → Privacy &amp; Consent, you can withdraw as easily as you gave consent. GST services pause and saved GST connections are removed. Requests already sent cannot be recalled. Withdrawal does not automatically close your account, erase legally necessary financial records or initiate a refund; account and refund access remain available.</p><h2>Privacy requests and grievances</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@primeserve.in">support@primeserve.in</a> for access, correction, erasure, withdrawal assistance or privacy complaints. Include your registered email and request, but never passwords, OTPs or UPI PINs. You may exercise applicable rights and approach the Data Protection Board of India through its official channels where available under the applicable legal framework.</p><p>See the <a href="https://www.primeserve.in/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">company Privacy Policy</a>.</p><a href="/account#privacy">Manage consent</a></section></main><?= view('brand_footer') ?></body></html>